revision.text:
'''Nishino Shrine''' (西野神社, ''Nishino jinja'') is a [[Shinto]] shrine located in [[Sapporo, Hokkaido]]. It was established in 1885, and enshrines the [[kami]] [[Toyotama-hime]] (豊玉姫命), [[Ugayafukiaezu]] no mikoto (鵜草葺不合命), and [[Emperor Ōjin]] as Hondawake no mikoto (譽田別命).
==See also== *[[List of Shinto shrines in Japan#Hokkaid.C5.8D|List of Shinto shrines in Hokkaidō]]
==External links== *[https://nishinojinja.or.jp Official website] *[https://hokkaidojinjacho.jp/西野神社/ Hokkaido Shinto listing]
{{Shinto shrine}}
[[Category:Shinto shrines in Hokkaido]]
{{Shinto-stub}}

