[[File:西野神社 拝殿.JPG|thumb|]]

'''Nishino Shrine''' (西野神社, ''Nishino jinja'') is a [[Shinto]] shrine located in [[:en:Sapporo, Hokkaido|Sapporo, Hokkaido]]. It was established in 1885, and enshrines the [[kami]] [[:en:Toyotama-hime|Toyotama-hime]] (豊玉姫命), [[Ugayafukiaezu]] no mikoto (鵜草葺不合命), and [[:en:Emperor Ōjin|Emperor Ōjin]] as Hondawake no mikoto (譽田別命). The shrine is constructed in the [[Shinmei-zukuri]] architectural style.

